<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets 4.0 bln Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets 4.0 bln Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    4.0 BLN DKR   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    18.NOV.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  11.00     PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.55	REOFFER    10.55     YIELD AT IP 7.635</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.45	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
